DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/dex/rules/{rule_id}
Delete a DEX Rule.
Required: account_id (path) — Unique Cloudflare account ID.; rule_id (path) — Unique identifier of the rule.

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/dex/devices/dex_tests/{dex_test_id}
Delete a Device DEX test. Returns the remaining device dex tests for the account.
Required: account_id (path) — Unique Cloudflare account ID.; dex_test_id (path) — Unique identifier for a DEX test.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/dex/devices/dex_tests/{dex_test_id}
Fetch a single DEX test.
Required: account_id (path) — Unique Cloudflare account ID.; dex_test_id (path) — Unique identifier for a DEX test.

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/dex/devices/dex_tests/{dex_test_id}
Update a DEX test.
Required: account_id (path) — Unique Cloudflare account ID.; dex_test_id (path) — Unique identifier for a DEX test.; body (body)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/dex/commands/{command_id}/downloads/{filename}
Downloads artifacts for an executed command. Bulk downloads are not supported
Required: account_id (path) — Unique Cloudflare account ID.; command_id (path) — Unique identifier for command.; filename (path) — The name of the file to be downloaded, including the `.zip` extension.

